## 其他列表接口
备注
- 参数与前面所有审批数量接口以及所有审批列表接口一致
请求方式：
- POST
接口：
| 接口名称 | 接口 |
| --- | --- |
| 待阅审批数量 | {OpenApiOrigin}/api/workflow/list/paService/v1/getToBeReadWorkflowRequestCount |
| 待阅审批列表 | {OpenApiOrigin}/api/workflow/list/paService/v1/getToBeReadWorkflowRequestList |
| 转发审批数量(只统计还在待办的) | {OpenApiOrigin}/api/workflow/list/paService/v1/getForwardWorkflowRequestCount |
| 转发审批列表(只统计还在待办的) | {OpenApiOrigin}/api/workflow/list/paService/v1/getForwardWorkflowRequestList |
| 待处理审批数量 | {OpenApiOrigin}/api/workflow/list/paService/v1/getDoingWorkflowRequestCount |
| 待处理审批列表 | {OpenApiOrigin}/api/workflow/list/paService/v1/getDoingWorkflowRequestList |
| 待办中抄送审批数量 | {OpenApiOrigin}/api/workflow/list/paService/v1/getCcWorkflowRequestCount |
| 待办中抄送审批列表 | {OpenApiOrigin}/api/workflow/list/paService/v1/getCcWorkflowRequestList |
| 待办中退回审批数量 | {OpenApiOrigin}/api/workflow/list/paService/v1/getBeRejectWorkflowRequestCount |
| 待办中退回审批列表 | {OpenApiOrigin}/api/workflow/list/paService/v1/getBeRejectWorkflowRequestList |
| 已结束审批列表 | {OpenApiOrigin}/api/workflow/list/paService/v1/getProcessedWorkflowRequestList |
| 已结束审批数量 | {OpenApiOrigin}/api/workflow/list/paService/v1/getProcessedWork |
Java sdk调用示例：
1. 待阅审批数量FlowVo flowVo = new FlowVo();
flowVo.setAccessToken(accessToken);
flowVo.setUserid(5140826883110054023L);
flowVo.setPageNo(1);
flowVo.setPageSize(20);

FlowCondition flowCondition = new FlowCondition();
//flowCondition.setWorkflowid("845943905646780417");
flowVo.setCondition(flowCondition);

FlowResultVo normalRes = FlowService.getToBeReadWorkflowRequestCountV1(flowVo, "{OpenApiOrigin}", null);
